<title>USA: Kodak extends CEO Fisher's contract.</title>
<headline>Kodak extends CEO Fisher's contract.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co said on Wednesday that it has extended the employment contract of its chairman and chief executive officer, George Fisher, for two years.</p>
<p>Kodak said that the terms of this extension, which expires on December 31, 2000, are amendments to Fisher's current contract, which expires December 31, 1998.</p>
</text>
